// # AArch64 hello
//
// Logline: Print Hello from main so emit-aarch64 can lower a println string.
//
// Setup: Side path is oodac/oodac.aarch64 emit-aarch64 on this file. No greet concat.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Print the Hello string.
//   3. Leave concat, calls, and product oodac dispatch residual.

pub fn main() {
    println("Hello");
}
